{
  "title": "Supplications at Sunrise & Sunset",
  "data": "Tahlil ×10\nBefore sunrise and before sunset, recite 10 times:\nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nThere is no god save Allah, alone without having any partner.\nلَهُ الْمُلْكُ وَلَهُ الْحَمْدُ\nLAHUL MULKU WA LAHUL HAMD\nTo Him is the kingdom and to Him is all praise.\nيُحْيِيْ وَيُمِيْتُ وَيُمِيْتُ وَيُحْيِيْ\nYUHYEE WA YUMEETU WA YUMEETU WA YUHYEE\nHe gives life and causes to die and causes to die and gives life,\nوَهُوَ حَيٌّ لَا يَمُوْتُ بِيَدِهِ الْخَيْرُ\nWA HUWA HAYYUN LAA YAMOOTU BIYADIHIL KHAYR\nwhile He is ever-living and never dies. In His hand is the good,\nوَهُوَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nWA HUWA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nand He has power over all things.\nIf you miss it, make it up later.",
  "tabs": [
    "Isti’adha ×10\nRecite 10 times before sunrise and before sunset:\nاَعُوْذُ بِاللّٰهِ السَّمِيْعِ الْعَلِيْمِ مِنْ هَمَزَاتِ الشَّيَاطِيْنِ\nA'OODHU BILLAAHIS SAMEE'IL A'LEEMI MIN HAMAZAATISH SHAYAATEEN\nI seek the protection of Allah, the All-hearing and All-knowing, against the evil suggestions of the devils,\nوَاَعُوْذُ بِاللّٰهِ اَنْ يَحْضُرُوْنِ\nWA A'OODHU BILLAAHI AN YAHDUROON\nand I seek Allah’s protection lest they be present with me.\nاِنَّ اللهَ هُوَ السَّمِيْعُ الْعَلِيْمُ\nINNALLAAHA HUWAS SAMEE'UL A'LEEM\nVerily, Allah is the All-hearing, the All-knowing.",
    "Dua Muqallib al-Qulub ×3\nRecite 3 times every morning and evening:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ مُقَلِّبَ الْقُلُوْبِ وَالْاَبْصَارِ\nALLAAHUMMA MUQALLIBAL QULOOBI WAL ABSAAR\nO Allah Who causes the changes of hearts and sights,\nثَبِّتْ قَلْبِيْ عَلٰى دِيْنِكَ\nTHABBIT QALBEE A'LAA DEENIK\n(please) make firm my heart on the course of Your religion,\nوَلَا تُزِغْ قَلْبِيْ بَعْدَ اِذْ هَدَيْتَنِيْ\nWA LAA TUZIGH QALBEE BA'DA IDH HADAYTANEE\ncause not my heart to stray off after You have guided me,\nوَهَبْ لِي مِنْ لَّدُنْكَ رَحْمَةً اِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْوَهَّابُ\nWA HAB LEE MIL LADUNKA RAHMATAN INNAKA ANTAL WAHHAAB\nand bestow upon me mercy from Your Presence. Surely, You are the All-bestower.\nوَاَجِرْنِي مِنَ النَّارِ بِرَحْمَتِكَ\nWA AJIRNEE MINAN NAARI BIRAHMATIK\nAnd save me from Hellfire out of Your mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ امْدُدْ لِي فِي عُمْرِيْ\nALLAAHUMMAM DUD LEE FEE U'MREE\nO Allah, (please) extend my lifetime,\nوَاَوْسِعْ عَلَيَّ فِي رِزْقِيْ\nWA AWSI' A'LAYYA FEE RIZQEE\nexpand my sustenance,\nوَانْشُرْ عَلَيَّ رَحْمَتَكَ\nWANSHUR A'LAYYA RAHMATAK\ncover me with Your mercy,\nوَاِنْ كُنْتُ عِنْدَكَ فِيْ اُمِّ الْكِتَابِ شَقِيًّا\nWA IN KUNTU I'NDAKA FEE UMMIL KITAABI SHAQIYYAA\nand if I am listed in the Mother of the Book with the unhappy ones,\nفَاجْعَلْنِيْ سَعِيْدًا\nFAJ'ALNEE SA'EEDAA\nplease include me with the happy ones,\nفَاِنَّكَ تَمْحُوْ مَا تَشَاۤءُ وَتُثْبِتُ وَعِنْدَكَ اُمُّ الْكِتَابِ\nFA-INNAKA TAMHOO MAA TASHAA'U WA TUTHBITU WA I'NDAKA UMMUL KITAAB\nfor, surely, You efface what You will, and establish what You will, and with You is the Mother of the Book.",
    "Dua al-Hamdu Lillahi Alladhi Yaf’alu\nRecite every morning and evening:\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْ يَفْعَلُ مَا يَشَاۤءُ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE YAF'ALU MAA YASHAA'\nAll praise be to Allah Who does whatever He wills,\nوَلَا يَفْعَلُ مَا يَشَاۤءُ غَيْرُهٗ\nWA LAA YAF'ALU MAA YASHAA'U GHAYRUH\nand none else can ever do whatever one wills.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ كَمَا يُحِبُّ اللهُ اَنْ يُّحْمَدَ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHI KAMAA YUHIBBULLAAHU AY YUHMAD\nAll praise be to Allah as much as Allah desires to be praised.\nالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ كَمَا هُوَ اَهْلُهٗ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHI KAMAA HUWA AHLUH\nAll praise be to Allah as much as He is worthy of praising.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَدْخِلْنِيْ فِي كُلِّ خَيْرٍ اَدْخَلْتَ فِيْهِ مُحَمَّدًا وَاٰلَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA ADKHILNEE FEE KULLI KHAYRIN ADKHALTA FEEHI MUHAMMADAN WA AALA MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, include me with each (item of) goodness with which You have included Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَخْرِجْنِيْ مِنْ كُلِّ سُوْٓءٍ اَخْرَجْتَ مِنْهُ مُحَمَّدًا وَاٰلَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA AKHRIJNEE MIN KULLI SOOO'IN AKHRAJTA MINHU MUHAMMADAN WA AALA MUHAMMAD\nand take me out of each (item of) evil from which You have taken out Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.\nصَلَّى اللهُ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nMay Allah bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.",
    "Tasbihat al-Arba’a & Dua Asharat\nEvery morning and evening, recite 10 times:\nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ وَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ وَلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَاللهُ اَكْبَرُ\nSUBHAANALLAAHI WAL HAMDU LILLAAHI WA LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WALLAAHU AKBAR\nAll glory be to Allah, all praise be to Allah, there is no god save Allah, and Allah is the Greatest.\nAlso recite [Dua Asharat](E10) every morning and evening."
  ],
  "merits": "Too many are the supplications that have been reported from the Holy Prophet and the Holy Imams, peace be upon them, to be said at sunrise and sunset. Besides, verses from the Holy Qur’an and traditions of the Infallibles, peace be upon them, have urged on and awakened desires for the persistence on saying such supplications at these two times of the day.\n\nTahlil ×10: Master Hadithists have narrated, through authenticated chain of authority (sanad), that Imam Ja’far al-Sadiq (a.s.) said: It is incumbent upon each and every Muslim to repeat this supplicatory prayer ten times before sunrise and ten times before sunset. According to some narrations, this supplication should be made up if it is missed because it is obligatory.\n\nIsti’adha ×10: Through trustworthy chains of authority too, Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) is reported to have said: Before sunrise and sunset, repeat this supplicatory prayer ten times.\n\nDua Muqallib al-Qulub ×3: Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) is also reported to have said: Nothing should divert you from saying this supplicatory prayer three times each morning and evening.\n\nDua al-Hamdu Lillahi Alladhi Yaf’alu: Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) is also reported to have instructed to say this supplicatory prayer each morning and evening."
